    "title": "FREE LIVE DRAG RACING: National Drag Racing Championship Finals Action From Santa Pod Raceway In England. Pro Mods And So Much More! - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chad Reynolds ,\n21 hours ago I’m blown away by the racing season they have had at Santa Pod Raceway in England this year. You never know what British weather is going to be like, but this year they have been blessed with amazing weather and awesome events that have fans talking about it non-stop. We love it, as we share as much content from Santa Pod as possible here at BANGshift. And this weekend is another great event that is headlined by Pro Mods, and 13 other door car classes, PLUS 10 Drag Bike classes as well! This one is going to be action packed and we love it. Tune in all weekend for the latest action! Read full article",
